  "description": {
    "en": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (en): Cladium mariscus",
      "source_url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cladium_mariscus",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 1306224600,
      "text": "Cladium mariscus is a species of flowering plant in the sedge family known by the common names swamp sawgrass, great fen-sedge, saw-sedge or sawtooth sedge. Previously it was known as elk sedge. It is native of temperate Europe and Asia where it grows in base-rich boggy areas and lakesides. It can be up to 2.5 metres tall, and has leaves with hard serrated edges. In the past, it was an important material to build thatched roofs; harvesting it was an arduous task due to its sharp edges that can cause deep lacerations."
    },
    "fr": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (fr): Cladium mariscus",
      "source_url": "https://fr.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cladium_mariscus",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 205029226,
      "text": "Cladium mariscus est une plante dont la classification en sous-espèce est controversée :\nLa sous-espèce Cladium mariscus subsp. jamaicense est considérée par certains auteurs comme une espèce séparée, Cladium jamaicense."
    },
    "pt": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (pt): Cladium mariscus",
      "source_url": "https://pt.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cladium_mariscus",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 59187866,
      "text": "Cladium mariscus é uma espécie de planta com flor pertencente à família Cyperaceae."
    },
    "id": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (id): Cladium mariscus",
      "source_url": "https://id.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cladium_mariscus",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 29548549,
      "text": "Cladium mariscus adalah spesies tumbuhan berbunga dalam suku teki-tekian (Cyperaceae) yang dikenal dengan nama umum swamp sawgrass, great fen-sedge, saw-sedge, atau sawtooth sedge. Sebelumnya, tumbuhan ini dikenal sebagai elk sedge. Tumbuhan ini merupakan tanaman asli Eropa dan Asia beriklim sedang, tempat ia tumbuh di area rawa kaya basa dan tepian danau. Tingginya bisa mencapai 25 meter (82 ft), dan memiliki daun dengan tepi bergerigi yang keras. Di masa lalu, tumbuhan ini merupakan bahan penting untuk membangun atap jerami; memanennya adalah tugas yang berat karena tepinya yang tajam dapat menyebabkan luka dalam."
    }
  },
